{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB全新煮食選秀節目《星廚》宣傳片中，除了有爆紅新人吳敬浩，其拍檔、24歲的陳芷珊（Tracy）同樣來頭不小 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB全新煮食選秀節目《星廚》宣傳片中，除了有爆紅新人吳敬浩，其拍檔、24歲的陳芷珊（Tracy）同樣來頭不小！樣貌甜美的她被揭是香港中文大學畢業生，不但精通五種語言，更擁有中國舞教師資格，其驚人的學霸及才女背景，絕對是美貌與智慧並重！\n</p>\n<h2>中大畢業精通五國語言 陳芷珊學霸背景嚇親網民</h2>\n<p>現年24歲的陳芷珊，畢業於本地著名學府香港中文大學，單是這項學歷已令不少人眼前一亮。更令人驚訝的是她的語言天賦，據悉她精通廣東話、普通話、英語、客家話及上海話共五種語言，溝通能力極強。在拍攝《星廚》宣傳片時，她以甜美外型彈結他賣萌，但鏡頭背後卻是個不折不扣的學霸，反差感極大。</p>\n<h2>陳芷珊舞功高強 2021年已考獲北京舞蹈學院教師資格</h2>\n<p>除了學業成績優異，陳芷珊的藝術造詣同樣出色。她自幼學習中國舞，舞蹈功底深厚，更早在2021年、年僅19歲時，已成功考獲北京舞蹈學院中國舞一至三年級的教師資格，可謂多才多藝。擁有專業舞蹈背景，難怪她在宣傳片中舉手投足都充滿氣質，鏡頭感十足，完美符合節目對「星味」的要求。\n</p>\n<h2>同為33期訓練班學員 陳芷珊曾參演《愛回家》多套劇集</h2>\n<p>陳芷珊與拍檔吳敬浩同為2024年第33期藝員訓練班的畢業生，入行後已獲得不少演出機會。她曾參演過多套TVB劇集，當中包括處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》、《愛．回家之三代同糖》以及《正義女神》等，雖然大多是小角色，但已為她累積了不少寶貴的幕前經驗，為日後的演藝事業打下基礎。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚才貌雙全：「TVB終於有高學歷靚女！」</h2>\n<p>陳芷珊的超強背景曝光後，引來網民熱議，不少人大讚她是「才貌雙全」的代表。網民紛紛留言：「又靚又叻女！中大畢業仲識五種語言，太屈機！」、「原來係舞蹈老師，唔怪得拍宣傳片咁有氣質。」、「TVB終於肯簽啲高學歷新人，希望佢有多啲機會！」、「睇過佢做《愛回家》，估唔到真人咁勁！」、「才貌雙全，支持Tracy！」\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18918224446ae97f9a8f91b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18918224446ae97f9a8f91b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15296971026ae97f9e077a1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15296971026ae97f9e077a1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_7563051466ae97fa1ce47d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_7563051466ae97fa1ce47d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5849192556ae97fa51baa4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5849192556ae97fa51baa4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_17779194546ae97fbacebc6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_17779194546ae97fbacebc6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2140309346ae97fc0bc19b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2140309346ae97fc0bc19b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20380693196ae97fc40c57a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20380693196ae97fc40c57a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TVB</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%98%9f%e5%bb%9a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">星廚</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%8a%b7%e7%8f%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳芷珊</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535114\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 3 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:22:20.645792+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1242,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:00:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:19:03.621155+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:19:01.019551+00:00","content_hash":"ff6890a0629e637636afe854ff92617e5be5376a7c61f2dab111d71dca84c494","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}